  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Dalton's law of partial pressures of gases,<br/><br/> <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub></math>             ...(i)<br/><br/>and according to Raoult's law<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>             ...(ii)<br/><br/>Now by equating (i) and (ii), we get<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
